OL,3,GNEWSAChemo hair loss doesn't define me
OL,4,A- it's a symbol that I'm strong
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Rhiannon Thomas lost her hair
OL,7,Fduring chemotherapy just weeks after
OL,8,Fhaving a mastectomy, her confidence was
OL,9,Fat an all time low.
OL,11,FBut being photographed for a campaign
OL,12,Fthat celebrates the resilience of women
OL,13,Fliving with breast cancer helped her
OL,14,Ffind an inner strength she never knew
OL,15,Fshe had.
OL,17,F"For the first time I feel I look
OL,18,Fpretty, I look confident and strong,"
OL,19,Fsaid the 36-year-old mum.
OL,21,F"It's surprising the strength you find
OL,22,Fwhen you go through such a hard time."
